ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Creo que va siendo
hora de que me marche.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Me lo he pasado muy bien!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gracias por acogerme en esta
maravilla de casa que tienes,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
bichín.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Hasta la próxima!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}that was fun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} But it's probably
time for me to get going.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Thanks for taking time out of your
busy schedule to have me over!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anyway, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}see you again soon!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vaya, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}¡cómo me lo he pasado!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pero me temo que se me está
haciendo un poquito tarde,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} cielo.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Muchas gracias por hacer un
huequecito en tu agenda para mí!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Hasta pronto!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hihi, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}das hat richtig Spaß gemacht!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber ich muss langsam wieder los.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Vielen Dank, dass du dir Zeit
für mich genommen hast.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bis zum nächsten Mal!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}çok eğlenceliydi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ama artık gitsem iyi olur.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Yoğun programından bana vakit ayırıp
ağırladığın için
teşekkürler!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Neyse, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}yakında yine görüşürüz!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I think it's about time I head home.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Time does fly when you're having
fun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thanks again for today.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
See you soon!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sanırım artık eve dönme vaktim geldi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}İnsan eğlenirken zaman nasıl da uçuyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün için tekrar teşekkürler.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yakında görüşürüz!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Şey, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}bir yere mi gidiyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Öyleyse, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}benim de çıkmam için iyi
bir zaman galiba.

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hımm? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Gitmen gereken bir yer mi var?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Sanırım bu benim de kalkma işaretim,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
